<title>USA: Green Oasis sees Q1 profit from sale.</title>
<headline>Green Oasis sees Q1 profit from sale.</headline>
<dateline>CHARLESTON, S.C. 1996-11-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Green Oasis Environmental Inc said on Wednesday that its agreement to sell a waste oil processing unit to Ardmore Capital Corp in Europe ensures that the company will be profitable in the first quarter of 1997.</p>
<p>This unit is being resold by Ardmore to a Spanish group and is the first of what is expected to be a total order for five processing units, Green Oasis said.</p>
<p>Terms were not disclosed, but payments will be made as manufacturing progresses, Green Oasis said. Final installation is estimated in March 1997.</p>
</text>
